# Production build-time configuration for the Member Portal.
#
# Vite loads this during `vite build` (production mode) and bakes the values into
# the client bundle. VITE_* values are public by design, so this is committed for
# deterministic production builds (no dependency on a build-time host variable).
# A platform-provided VITE_API_BASE_URL, if set, still overrides this.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://superdreams-production.up.railway.app
